{
  "_comment": "The Système's missions (Managers/Stasis/Missions.cs, spec §10 and §22). Chapters follow each other by level band; their missions name a kind and numbers, and the zone, monster, dungeon or achievement is drawn from the game's data near the character's level when the mission starts (target 0), then kept. kinds: fights (won fights in a zone), kills (monsters of one kind), orbes (Orbes earned in fights; count in kamas, turned into Jondo Coins), level (level to reach; 0 = band top), dungeon (finish a dungeon of the band), achievement (an exploration achievement of the band), hatch (eggs hatched at the Pension; skipped while the Pension is off). Titles: optional, with {count} {zone} {monster} {dungeon} {achievement} {level} {orbes}. rewardKamas/finalKamas and trackBonusKamasPerLevel are kamas paid as Orbes; xp shares are of the experience between the character's level and the next.",
